Please cite the paper when using the data:

Van Buskirk, I., Hohmann, M., Landgren, E., Ugander, J., Clauset, A., & Larremore, D. B.
Consensus and fragmentation in academic publication preferences. Science Advances (2026).

Survey responses are de-identified. Institutional prestige is provided only as deciles and
terciles of the Academic Analytics hiring-network prestige ranking and as an anonymous
institution index; institution names, identifiers and ranks are not included. Researchers who
need the underlying faculty census should request it from Academic Analytics directly.
